# ── .dockerignore — Holiday Leave Assistant ───────────────────────────────────
# Prevents secrets, build artefacts, IDE files, and runtime data from being
# sent to the Docker/Podman build daemon.  Keeps the build context small and
# ensures no secrets are baked into the image.

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env

# ── Runtime data (not needed at build time; mounted as volumes at runtime) ────
data/
reports/

# ── Maven build output (rebuilt inside the builder stage) ────────────────────
backend/target/

# ── IDE and OS artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/

# ── Git metadata ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore

# ── Other compose / deploy files (not needed inside the image) ────────────────
docker-compose.yml
podman-compose.yml

# ── Documentation and diagrams ────────────────────────────────────────────────
README.md
diagrams/
*.html
